questions.answer:
Prints **A D C B**. Synchronous code runs first; then the **microtask** queue (promise callbacks) is drained; then the next **macrotask** (timers).
```js
function debounce(fn, ms) {
  let timer;
  return (...args) => {
    clearTimeout(timer);
    timer = setTimeout(() => fn(...args), ms);
  };
}
```
Debounce waits until typing stops (search box); throttle runs at most once per interval (scroll handlers).

